<title>POLAND: Polish Unilever sells PLN 10.5 mln CPs.</title>
<headline>Polish Unilever sells PLN 10.5 mln CPs.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish unit of Unilever sold on Monday 10.5 million zlotys worth of two-month commercial paper at an average yield of 18.7 percent, the manager of Unilever's commercial paper programme said.</p>
<p>The Polish unit of the Internationale Nederlanden Groep said in a statement the CPs, called KWIT, came from an 80 million zloty programme started in April 1995.</p>
<p>-- Jan Strupczewski +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
